<title>USA: Markel Corp Q1 net rises.</title>
<headline>Markel Corp Q1 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>RICHMOND, Va. 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended</p>
<p>								March 31,</p>
<p>							1997	     1996</p>
<p>						   (dollars in thousands,</p>
<p>						   except per share data)</p>
<p>  Total revenues				$98,473	 $92,990</p>
<p> Net income					 8,790	   7,810</p>
<p>Earnings per share</p>
<p>  Primary					    1.56	    1.38</p>
<p>  Fully diluted				    1.56	    1.38</p>
<p>NOTE: The company said core operations increased 51 percent due to its acquisition of Investors Insurance Holding Corp in Q4 1996.</p>
</text>
